From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] propsys: FILETIME, STRRET, resource and serialization conversions (2045)

propsys: FILETIME, STRRET, resource and serialization conversions.

InitPropVariantFromFileTime, PropVariantToFileTime (UTC or local),
PropVariantToFileTimeVector(Alloc), InitVariantFromFileTimeArray,
VariantToFileTime, VariantToDosDateTime, VariantToBuffer, the STRRET
initialisers and converters (InitPropVariantFromStrRet, InitVariantFromStrRet,
PropVariantToStrRet, VariantToStrRet), InitPropVariantFromStringAsVector,
InitPropVariantFromResource, InitVariantFromResource, the vector element
copies (InitPropVariantFromPropVariantVectorElem,
InitPropVariantVectorFromPropVariant, InitVariantFromVariantArrayElem),
ClearVariantArray, StgSerializePropVariant / StgDeserializePropVariant (the
OLE property-set value layout) and PSGetNameFromPropertyKey. They were stubs.
Also drops three todo_wine marks in the setupapi tests that now pass
(CryptCATPersistStore works).
---
